IDENTIFICATION DIVISION. PROGRAM-ID. FLOWCASE.
DATA DIVISION. WORKING-STORAGE SECTION. 01 N PIC 9.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN-P.
ACCEPT N
PERFORM BODY-P
GO TO EXIT-P.
BODY-P.
IF N >= 1 DISPLAY 'HIGH' ELSE DISPLAY 'LOW' END-IF
EVALUATE N WHEN 0 DISPLAY 'ZERO' WHEN 1 DISPLAY 'ONE' END-EVALUATE.
EXIT-P.
GOBACK.
